/b2b-ecommerce-development-and-consulting/">B2B Ecommerce Development</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/replatforming/">Replatforming</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/systems-integration/">Systems Integration</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://elogic.co/projects/">Case Studies</a> </li> </ul> </div> <div> <p class="header-search__zero-title">Tools</p> <ul> <li> <a href="https://elogic.co/ecommerce-platform-selector/">Ecommerce Platform Selector</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://elogic.co/adobe-commerce-team-cost-calculator/">Team Cost Calculator</a> </li> <li> <a href="https://elogic.co/adobe-commerce-capacity-gap-assessment/">Capacity Gap Assessment</a> </li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="header-search__matches" data-header-search-matches hidden> <p class="search-results">Search results</p> <div class="header-search__groups" role="listbox" aria-label="Search results"> <div class="header-search__group" data-header-search-group="service" hidden> <p class="header-search__group-label" id="elogic-header-search-group-service">Services</p> <div aria-labelledby="elogic-header-search-group-service" data-header-search-group-items></div> </div> <div class="header-search__group" data-header-search-group="solution" hidden> <p class="header-search__group-label" id="elogic-header-search-group-solution">Solutions</p> <div aria-labelledby="elogic-header-search-group-solution" data-header-search-group-items></div> </div> <div class="header-search__group" data-header-search-group="integration" hidden> <p class="header-search__group-label" id="elogic-header-search-group-integration">Integrations</p> <div aria-labelledby="elogic-header-search-group-integration" data-header-search-group-items></div> </div> <div class="header-search__group" data-header-search-group="project" hidden> <p class="header-search__group-label" id="elogic-header-search-group-project">Case Studies</p> <div aria-labelledby="elogic-header-search-group-project" data-header-search-group-items></div> </div> </div> </div> <aside class="header-search__guidance" data-header-search-guidance hidden> <span>Suggested next step</span> <strong>Not sure which route fits?</strong> <p>A senior architect can map the right service or solution before you commit budget.</p> <a href="https://elogic.co/commerce-architecture-blueprint/" data-search-assessment>Get an Assessment</a> </aside> <div class="header-search__none" data-header-search-none hidden> <strong>No pages match your search yet.</strong> <span>A senior architect can map your case instead:</span> <a href="https://elogic.co/services/">All Services &amp; Platforms</a> <a href="https://elogic.co/solutions/">All Industries</a> <a href="https://elogic.co/integrations/">All Integrations</a> <a href="https://elogic.co/projects/">All Case Studies</a> </div> <p class="screen-reader-text" aria-live="polite" data-header-search-status></p> <div class="header-search__footer"> <span>Evaluating platforms or partners?</span> <a href="https://elogic.co/commerce-architecture-blueprint/" class="header-search__assessment" data-search-assessment>Get an Assessment</a> </div> </div> </form> </div> </header> <div class="overlay-body"></div> <a class="btn_to_top" title="top"></a> <main id="about-us-page" class="about-us-page"> <section class="section-standard section-about section-hero nitro-lazy"> <div class="main-container"> <div class="section-about-header"> <p class="last-updated" style="color:#6b6b6b;font-size:11px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:8px"> Last updated: <time datetime="2026-09-24"><b>September 2026</b></time> </p> <h1 class="section-about-title"> About Elogic Commerce - Ecommerce Development Company for Complex B2B &amp; B2B2C </h1> <p class="section-about-description"> Elogic Commerce is an <a href="https://elogic.co/services/ecommerce-website-development-dubai-and-uae/ ">ecommerce development</a> company specializing exclusively in ecommerce solutions across Adobe Commerce (Magento), <a href="https://elogic.co/blog/the-guide-to-shopify-plus-benefits-and-core-features/">Shopify Plus</a>, Salesforce Commerce Cloud, BigCommerce, and commercetools. Founded in 2009, we deliver complex B2B and integration-heavy commerce projects - platform development, migrations, and integrations with ERP, PIM, and CRM systems. We are certified and partner-aligned across key platforms, supporting mid-market and enterprise clients in the US and Europe through dedicated teams and long-term support models. </p> </div> <div class="section-hero-stats"> <div class="section-hero-stats-item"> <div class="section-hero-stats-item-val"> 500 <span>+</span> </div> <div class="section-hero-stats-item-info"> Projects delivered </div> </div> <div class="section-hero-stats-item"> <div class="section-hero-stats-item-val"> 200 <span>+</span> </div> <div class="section-hero-stats-item-info"> Ecommerce experts </div> </div> <div class="section-hero-stats-item"> <div class="section-hero-stats-item-val"> 17 <span>+</span> </div> <div class="section-hero-stats-item-info"> Years in ecommerce </div> </div> <div class="section-hero-stats-item"> <div class="section-hero-stats-item-val"> NPS 70 </div> <div class="section-hero-stats-item-info"> Based on post-launch client surveys </div> </div> </div> <div class="section-hero-image"> <img width="1500" height="1000" alt="about-img" fetchpriority="high" sizes="(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px" title="about-img" nitro-lazy-srcset="https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/about-img.webp 1500w, https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/about-img-300x200.webp 300w, https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh/assets/images/optimized/rev-0802193/elogic.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/about-img-1024x683.webp 1024w, https://cdn-cahge.nitrocdn.com/mAPkqokVpTrmAtoawHbGRdGNnCYBNdZh